stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DESIGN_NEEDED

    DESIGN_NEEDED --> ADR_GATE: ka-plan locks, route == COMPLEX_MODE
    DESIGN_NEEDED --> LOCKED_DECISION: ka-plan locks (PATCH / STANDARD / FAST_TRACK)

    ADR_GATE --> LOCKED_DECISION: 🛑 human APPROVE
    ADR_GATE --> DESIGN_NEEDED: REJECT

    state Execute {
        [*] --> ReadHandoff
        ReadHandoff --> ValidateSchema
        ValidateSchema --> RiskTierConfirm: tier 3-4 always 🛑
        RiskTierConfirm --> RouteToWorker
        RouteToWorker --> [*]
    }

    LOCKED_DECISION --> Execute: ka-workflow Execute stage
    Execute --> TEST_GATE: EXECUTE_BE / FE / SCHEMA / CONTRACT / TEST
    Execute --> DEPLOYMENT_GATE: EXECUTE_OPS

    TEST_GATE --> REVIEW_GATE: PASS (script-run RED + GREEN)
    TEST_GATE --> BLOCKED: FAIL

    REVIEW_GATE --> BUILD_DONE: 🛑 APPROVE / SUCCESS_NO_UI
    REVIEW_GATE --> BE_FE_GATE_ON_UI: 🛑 SUCCESS_WITH_UI
    REVIEW_GATE --> LOCKED_DECISION: 🛑 REQUEST_CHANGES

    BE_FE_GATE_ON_UI --> LOCKED_DECISION: 🛑 APPROVE (then EXECUTE_FE)
    BE_FE_GATE_ON_UI --> BUILD_DONE: SKIP_UI

    BUILD_DONE --> LOCKED_DECISION: NEXT_STEP
    BUILD_DONE --> DEPLOYMENT_GATE: PROPOSE_DEPLOY
    BUILD_DONE --> COMPLETION_GATE: SKIP_DEPLOY

    DEPLOYMENT_GATE --> DEPLOY_RESULT: 🛑 APPROVE
    DEPLOYMENT_GATE --> BUILD_DONE: REJECT
    DEPLOY_RESULT --> COMPLETION_GATE: SUCCESS
    DEPLOY_RESULT --> BLOCKED: FAILURE

    COMPLETION_GATE --> READY_TO_ARCHIVE: 🛑 APPROVE
    COMPLETION_GATE --> LOCKED_DECISION: REQUEST_CHANGES

    BLOCKED --> LOCKED_DECISION: 🛑 RESUME_PATCH (max 3 resets)
    BLOCKED --> TEST_GATE: 🛑 RESUME_TEST
    BLOCKED --> REVIEW_GATE: 🛑 RESUME_REVIEW
    BLOCKED --> DESIGN_NEEDED: ROLLBACK_TO_DESIGN / 4th reset

    READY_TO_ARCHIVE --> [*]

    note right of TEST_GATE
        Only runs executed by
        state-manager.js test count.
    end note

    note right of BLOCKED
        🛑 = needs --approved-by-user,
        logged to approvals.log
    end note
